<title>GERMANY: Bundesbank data show fall in net reserves in week.</title>
<headline>Bundesbank data show fall in net reserves in week.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bundesbank data released on Friday show that net currency reserves fell to about 103.4 billion marks in the week ending January 23 from about 104.1 billion marks in the week ending January 15.</p>
<p>The Bundesbank provided the following reserve data: (in billion marks)</p>
<p> Banking week ended		    Jan 23	  Jan 15</p>
<p> Gross currency reserves	     119	     119.7</p>
<p> Foreign liabilities		   15.6	    15.6</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
